WEEK 12 — RETURNS AND GST CREDIT NOTES

Date: Monday, 26 October 2026

Problem: A refund of the whole line total did not match the original invoice when only some units of an item were returned.

Solution:
- Each returned unit takes its pro-rata share of taxable value and GST, in whole paise.
- Checked that returning every unit reverses the original invoice to the paisa.
- Numbered credit notes per financial year (FC/CN/2627/000001), as GST requires.
- Refused food items and returns after 30 days, and blocked returning more than was bought.
- Saved restock, points update and credit note in one database transaction, so they succeed or fail together.
